% Honest edge case — 0% OF anything is 0, and the engine COMPUTES it (it does not
% special-case or invent): (50 × 0) / 100 = 0. (Uncomment to see it.)
% ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% observe rate(0)
% ? percent_of(whole, rate)
